Check byte equality base: 
Original: `'gh repo clone ' + o + '/' + r + ' + dir + ' --no-tags --single-branch --branch ' + branchName + ' --depth 200' + ' && cd ' + dir + ' && git fetch...'`
New: `'gh repo clone ' + o + '/' + r + ' + dir + ' -- ' + headFlags + ' && cd ' + dir + '' + ' && git fetch...'` where headFlags = `'--no-tags --single-branch --branch ' + branchName + ' --depth 200'`. → identical string. ✓
